# Line endings (platform COPILOT-4, 2026-09-03, applied preventively): shell scripts, Python, YAML,
# JSON, TOML and Markdown are LF in the repository. A script committed with CRLF fails on Linux
# (`set -euo pipefail\r`: "invalid option name"). Binary/office files stay opaque.
#
# *.md was added 2026-09-07 (L36). Without it a Markdown file that picked up CRLF showed as a
# whole-file diff - 78 changed lines in evidence/INDEPENDENT-VERIFICATION-RESULT.md with not one
# character of content different - which is noise that hides real evidence changes. The
# pharmacovigilance pack had no .gitattributes at all and had committed four files with CRLF.
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.toml  text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.pptx  binary
*.docx  binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.drawio text eol=lf
